N A FEDERAL SECURITIES CLASS ACTION THAT HAS BEEN FILED AGAINST THE COMPANY. IF YOU SUFFERED LOSSES EXCEEDING $50,000 INVESTING IN PAYPAL STOCK OR OPTIONS...'}{'symbol': 'PEP', 'date': '2021-09-23 11:30:00', 'title': 'FRITO-LAY® LAUNCHES INDUSTRIALLY COMPOSTABLE BAGS WITH OFF THE EATEN PATH® BRAND; ADVANCES IN GOAL TO DESIGN 100% OF PACKAGING TO BE RECYCLABLE, COMPOSTABLE, BIODEGRADABLE OR REUSABLE ACROSS PORTFOLIO BY 2025', 'text': 'PLANO, TEXAS, SEPT. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FRITO-LAY, A DIVISION OF PEPSICO® AND LEADER IN SNACKING, TODAY INTRODUCED AN INDUSTRIALLY COMPOSTABLE BAG FOR ITS OFF THE EATEN PATH® BRAND.'}{'symbol': 'PPG', 'date': '2021-09-23 12:31:00', 'title': 'SICO PAINT BY PPG UNVEILS 2022 COLOUR OF THE YEAR: COOL CURRENT', 'text': "TORONTO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AFTER A YEAR OF STAY-AT-HOME ORDERS AND LIVING IN A LARGELY DIGITAL WORLD WITH TOO FEW IRL (IN-REAL-LIFE) MOMENTS, CANADIANS ARE CRAVING AUTHENTICITY, NATURE AND MEANINGFUL HUMAN INTERACTION. THIS REALITY HAS INSPIRED SICO® PAINT BRAND BY PPG TO SELECT COOL CURRENT (6199-42) – A SOPHISTICATED, GROUNDED, VERSATILE AND HIGHLY-ADAPTABLE GREY-GREEN – AS ITS 2022 COLOUR OF THE YEAR. COOL CURRENT IS A RELAXED YET ENTICING GREEN THAT REPRESENTS REGROWTH, MIMICKING NATURE'S RE"}{'symbol': 'PPG', 'date': '2021-09-23 09:16:00', 'title': 'DULUX PAINTS BY PPG UNVEILS RICH, HEALING OLIVE SPRIG AS 2022 COLOUR OF THE YEAR', 'text': "TORONTO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AFTER YEARS OF PLAYING IT SAFE WITH NEUTRAL DECOR, CANADIANS ARE EAGER TO INTRODUCE AN INFUSION OF COLOUR INTO THEIR HOMES. NOT JUST ANY COLOUR – THINK SOOTHING, SATURATED TONES THAT REPRESENT HEALING, REGROWTH AND RESILIENCY AFTER A YEAR OF UNCERTAINTY, SOCIAL ISOLATION, AND LIVING AND WORKING REMOTELY AMID THE PANDEMIC. THAT'S THE FORECAST OF DULUX® PAINTS BY PPG IN ANNOUNCING OLIVE SPRIG (DLX1125-4) AS ITS 2022 COLOUR OF THE YEAR. REMINISCENT OF NATURE, THIS GROUNDE"}{'symbol': 'PPL', 'date': '2021-09-23 17:22:00', 'title': 'PPL CORPORATION RECEIVES FERC APPROVAL TO ACQUIRE THE NARRAGANSETT ELECTRIC COMPANY', 'text': 'ALLENTOWN, PA., SEPT. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PPL CORPORATION (NYSE: PPL) TODAY RECEIVED UNANIMOUS APPROVAL FROM THE FEDERAL ENERGY REGULATORY COMMISSION TO ACQUIRE THE NARRAGANSETT ELECTRIC COMPANY FROM NATIONAL GRID USA.'}{'symbol': 'PLD', 'date': '2021-09-23 09:00:00', 'title': 'PROLOGIS EXPANDS LOGISTICS TRAINING PROGRAM IN SIX MAJOR U.S. CITIES', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO, SEPT. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PROLOGIS, INC. (NYSE: PLD), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN LOGISTICS REAL ESTATE, WILL EXPAND ITS COMMUNITY WORKFORCE INITIATIVE (CWI) TRAINING PROGRAM IN SIX MAJOR MARKETS IN THE U.S., CREATING MORE EDUCATIONAL OPPORTUNITIES FOR PEOPLE SEEKING CAREERS IN LOGISTICS.'}{'symbol': 'PRU', 'date': '2021-09-23 09:55:00', 'title': 'THE SCION GROUP AND PGIM REAL ESTATE FORM JOINT VENTURE, ACQUIRE TWO U.S. STUDENT HOUSING PROPERTIES', 'text': "CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE SCION GROUP AND PGIM REAL ESTATE, THE REAL ESTATE INVESTMENT AND FINANCING ARM OF PRUDENTIAL FINANCIAL'S GLOBAL ASSET MANAGEMENT BUSINESS, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THEIR RECENTLY FORMED JOINT VENTURE HAS COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF TWO CLASS A STUDENT HOUSING COMMUNITIES TOTALING 1,244 BEDROOMS. BOTH PROPERTIES WERE DELIVERED IN FALL 2020: “VERVE” SERVING STUDENTS AT THE MAIN CAMPUS OF RUTGERS UNIVERSITY IN NEW BRUNSWICK, N.J.; AND “AERO ON 24TH” SERVING THE UNIVERSIT"}{'symbol': 'PTC', 'date': '2021-09-23 09:00:00', 'title': 'PTC PROVIDES "LEADING AR PLATFORM FOR CONNECTED WORKERS IN THE MARKET TODAY," ACCORDING TO TEKNOWLOGY GROUP', 'text': 'BOSTON, SEPT. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PTC\xa0(NASDAQ: PTC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT, FOR THE THIRD YEAR IN A ROW, ITS VUFORIA® ENTERPRISE AUGMENTED REALITY SUITE (AR) HAS BEEN NAMED A "BEST IN CLASS" TECHNOLOGY IN TEKNOWLOGY GROUP\'S LATEST PAC RADAR VENDOR ANALYSIS.'}{'symbol': 'RTX', 'date': '2021-09-23 14:00:00', 'title': 'RAYTHEON INTELLIGENCE & SPACE EXPANDS INNOVATION AND MANUFACTURING FOOTPRINT IN NORT